Interpolation is HTML-escaped; use triple braces (`{{{name}}}`) for raw text.
The language also supports comments, `{{#if path}}…{{else}}…{{/if}}`, and
`{{#each path}}…{{else}}…{{/each}}`. Within an `each`, `{{this}}` and
`{{@index}}` refer to the current element, while ordinary paths read from root data.

Run the CLI with:

```sh
bun run src/cli.ts TEMPLATE_FILE DATA.json
```

Run self-tests with `bun test`.
